{"kind":"dictionary","items":[
{"k":"help.faq.journal-private-photos.question","en":"Can I keep private photos?"},
{"k":"help.faq.journal-private-photos.subtitle","en":"To track certain visual changes."},
{"k":"help.faq.journal-private-photos.answer","en":"Yes. Secure private photos are available, for example to track how acne, hair growth or skin symptoms evolve."},
{"k":"help.faq.security-private-data.question","en":"How does AWA protect my data?"},
{"k":"help.faq.security-private-data.subtitle","en":"Privacy, security and minimal collection."},
{"k":"help.faq.security-private-data.answer","en":"AWA is built on minimal data collection, no targeted advertising, no reselling of personal data, and secure storage with real encryption of sensitive data."},
{"k":"help.faq.security-export.question","en":"Can I export my data?"},
{"k":"help.faq.security-export.subtitle","en":"PDF and CSV exports are supported."},
{"k":"help.faq.security-export.answer","en":"Yes. A PDF export of your tracking and a CSV export of your data are available, so you can build a clear history, including for a healthcare professional."},
{"k":"help.faq.security-delete.question","en":"Can I delete my data easily?"},
{"k":"help.faq.security-delete.subtitle","en":"Deletion stays simple and accessible."},
{"k":"help.faq.security-delete.answer","en":"Yes. Simplified deletion of your data and account is available from the relevant settings."},
